requirements fire_extinguishers v1
description "Where the distances of the rulec corpus rule osha_extinguisher.rule come from: 29 CFR 1910.157(d), borrowed from the copy the rule pins. A test fixture; it does not say how the regulation is to be read"

role safety "decides how the regulation reads"
role dev "writes and corrects the rule"

source osha = rulec "rules/osha_extinguisher.rule" source osha

requirement travel_distance
  text "Portable fire extinguishers for Class A hazards are placed so that the travel distance to any extinguisher is 75 feet or less, and for Class B hazards 50 feet or less"
  in force 2026-01-01..
  owner safety
  from @osha "§1910.157"
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by safety sha256:c2a9ce966c7e2269 -> sha256:849dc53f1d112c23
  satisfied by rulec "rules/osha_extinguisher.rule" table distance
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by dev sha256:849dc53f1d112c23 -> sha256:5681500476af8a56
  not verified "rulec checks that the table covers every hazard; this fixture names no claim"
    approved 2026-10-04 by safety sha256:849dc53f1d112c23
